  "description": "Given an array of apple weights, return the maximum number of apples that can fit in a basket with a capacity of 5000 units.",
  "target": 5000,
  "pseudocode": "1. weight.sort((a, b) => a - b);\n2. let count = 0, sum = 0;\n3. for (let i = 0; i < weight.length; i++) {\n4.   if (sum + weight[i] <= 5000) {\n5.     sum += weight[i];\n6.     count++;\n7.   } else break;\n8. }",
